# `data/*` (not `data/`) so the seed files can be re-included one by one: they must ship in the image,
# while the local SQLite db/wal files next to them must not. Every file a loader reads has to be named
# here — a forgotten line is not a build error, it is a 503 in production. `tests/test_packaging.py`
# checks the list against the loaders.
data/*
!data/places.json
!data/place_guides.json
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
